confirm_install_candidate.description:
The panel has no installed or retained ha-paneld package. Check the device and verified stable release:

- Address: {address}
- Model: {model}
- Serial: {serial}
- ABI: {abi}
- Android SDK: {sdk}
- Version: {version}
- Tag: {tag}
- SHA-256: {sha256}

Submit to recheck the panel, then download, verify, install, launch and health-check this exact release. An existing installation will not be overwritten or upgraded.

After Home Assistant adds the device, select Set up on the panel to complete ha-paneld's guided setup. Installation does not configure the dashboard.

